Output assets/search.gif

Source assets/tapes/style.tape

Hide
Type "source assets/demo/setup.sh" Enter
Type "nvim -i NONE -n --cmd 'luafile assets/demo/demo-init.lua' $OBSIDIAN_BASE_DIR/Demo/Search.md" Enter
Sleep 10s
Show
